graph TD
    A[Original Jumbled Sentence] --> B[Identify Parts Q, P, S, R]
    B --> C[Part Q]
    B --> D[Part P]
    B --> E[Part S]
    B --> F[Part R]
    C --> G[Place Q first]
    D --> G
    E --> G
    F --> G
    G --> H[Construct Sentence: Q → P → S → R]
    H --> I[Validate Grammar]
    I --> J[Correct Sentence]
    class H correct;
    classDef correct fill:#e0ffe0,stroke:#2c7,stroke-width:2px;